Third-party code in this project
================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this project's own code. Two files come from
Espressif and stay under their own licence:

  firmware/knob/src/esp_lcd_sh8601.c
  firmware/knob/src/esp_lcd_sh8601.h

    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2023 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

A full copy of the Apache License 2.0 is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt, as section
4(a) of that licence requires when the work is redistributed.

This note lives here rather than at the bottom of LICENSE because appending to
LICENSE stops GitHub recognising the file as MIT: it matches the text against
known licences, and the extra paragraphs drop it below the threshold. The repo
then reports its licence as "Other", which is worse for anyone trying to work
out whether they can use this.

Transcription is whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp).
Hardware and demo sources are Waveshare's.
